            <ArticleTitle>Discovery of a potent, orally bioavailable pyrimidine VLA-4 antagonist effective in a sheep asthma model.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1741-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.bmcl.2011.01.075</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A series of N-(pyrimidin-4-yl)-phenylalanine VLA-4 antagonists is described. Optimization of substituents at the 2 and 5 positions of the pyrimidine ring gave 14, a very potent VLA-4 inhibitor which is orally active in a sheep asthma model.</AbstractText>
